{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_versioned_envelope", "label": "Versioned envelope { _v, _t, _e }", "file_type": "document", "rationale": "Underscored keys so they cannot collide with user fields; any object carrying all three is treated as an envelope. It is a regular JSON object stored through the tagged JSON tree format, so rich types round-trip inside _e and a store-level custom serializer frames the whole envelope.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_storedframe", "label": "StoredFrame", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_outboundframe", "label": "OutboundFrame", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_eventadapter", "label": "EventAdapter", "file_type": "document", "rationale": "manifest + toJournal cover the write path; fromJournal(stored) covers the read path, inspecting stored.version and transforming an older payload to the current shape. The built-in adapters encapsulate this pattern and custom adapters implement the same interface.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_strict_envelope_read", "label": "Strict envelope read", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Configuring an adapter makes the framework wrap on write and unwrap on read, and reading a non-envelope event then throws MigrationError. Enveloped and raw events cannot be mixed for one persistenceId without a WrapLegacy pass first; removing an adapter later leaves envelopes being fed to onEvent as-is.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_reserved_underscore_fields", "label": "Reserved underscore fields", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "_v, _t and _e are framework-reserved; an event payload that declares one of them collides with the envelope.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_strict_envelope_read", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_versioned_envelope", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_reserved_underscore_fields", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_versioned_envelope", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/persistence/migration/envelope-format.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_envelope_format_versioned_envelope", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_persistence_migration_wrap_legacy_migrateinmemoryj